    "answer": "that's-enough!/cut-it-out!/get-a-life!",
    "mnemonic": "You know how <ja>いい加減</ja> is unfounded or pointless? Because if you <kanji>add</kanji> and then <kanji>decrease</kanji> you haven't really done anything? Well, this is like saying \"do the pointless!\" Okay, that doesn't make any sense. This is a phrase that means something similar to <vocabulary>cut it out</vocabulary> or <vocabulary>cut the BS</vocabulary>!",
